3. 🥬 Lettuce prices wilt
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: BLS series CUSR0000SEFL02 ; Chart: Erin Davis/Axios Visuals Lettuce is experiencing an explosive decline in stores.

 The cyclospora outbreak linked to iceberg lettuce has sparked a massive drop in prices, as consumers steered clear of supermarket lettuce bins. 📉 By the numbers: CPI numbers released today by the Bureau of Labor Statistics showed that lettuce prices plunged 16.4% from June to July.

 That was the largest decline ever, by a long shot. 
 
 
